        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71604450?u=79548cbe7914224fa6b99d125b5b5dcf4b306a6f&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>MDN URL: <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Selection/getRangeAt\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Selection/getRangeAt</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>GitHub URL: <a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/blob/main/files/en-us/web/api/selection/getrangeat/index.md\">https://github.com/mdn/content/blob/main/files/en-us/web/api/selection/getrangeat/index.md</a></li>\n<li>Last commit: <a class=\"commit-link\" data-hovercard-type=\"commit\" data-hovercard-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/commit/4f35a8237ee0842beb9cfef3354e05464ad7ce1a/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/commit/4f35a8237ee0842beb9cfef3354e05464ad7ce1a\"><tt>4f35a82</tt></a></li>\n</ul>",
